Change the class declaration from 'class Test_Suite_01_Add_Shortcut(unittest.TestCase):' to 'class Test_Suite_01_Add_Shortcut(object):'. This follows the HPX framework standard pattern where test classes inherit from 'object' to work properly with pytest's class-based test organization and fixture system. The correct pattern is:

```python
class Test_Suite_01_Add_Shortcut(object):
    @pytest.fixture(scope="class", autouse=True)
    def class_setup(cls, <fixtures>):
        # Setup code
        pass
```

Also remove the 'import unittest' statement as it is not needed in pytest-based test files.

